# jeyanandan.com. A personal site: an introduction, the writing, and one
# outbound link to ko-fi.com. Nothing is submitted, and the only thing embedded
# is YouTube video in the writing (see FRAMES below). Fonts are the system's,
# there is no CDN and no analytics. img-src allows data: for the one-byte inline
# favicon in Base.astro.
#
# FRAMES, 2026-09-28. frame-src was 'none'. It now names www.youtube.com (and
# www.youtube-nocookie.com, so an embed can be switched to the no-cookie host
# without touching this file) because /blog/meta-dax/ embeds the 2024 Meta DAX
# prototype walk-through, on Jason's instruction. Nothing else may be framed.
# frame-ancestors 'none' and X-Frame-Options: DENY are about the opposite
# direction -- nobody may frame THIS site -- and stay exactly as they were.
#
# 2026-09-20, with the product pages: frame-src named ko-fi.com for a donation
# iframe that was replaced by a plain outbound link; form-action named ko-fi.com
# for a payment form that is not on the page; connect-src named
# api.formaddie.com and media-src allowed blob:/data: for the recorder, which is
# no longer built; and microphone=(self) was that recorder's microphone. All of
# them are gone. Verified against the built pages before the change: no iframe,
# frame, embed, object, form, formaction, script, fetch, XMLHttpRequest,
# WebSocket, getUserMedia, MediaRecorder, audio, video or blob: on any of /,
# /blog/, /blog/snowflake-fuckari-in-action/ or the 404.
#
# CACHING, 2026-09-20. HTML is never held by a shared cache without revalidation:
# a page removed from src/ has to stop being served promptly. /* carries the
# no-cache the home page already had, and that covers every HTML document plus
# /version.json.
#
# Pages APPENDS matching rules, it does not override them. Measured on this site
# 2026-09-20: a /* rule plus a / rule produced the literal header
# "no-cache, must-revalidate, no-cache, must-revalidate", and /blog/* doubled it
# again. So do NOT add a second Cache-Control rule for a path /* already covers.
# The asset rules below are additive on purpose: the zone sets the base value for
# static files (measured: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate) and the rule
# here contributes the shared-cache lifetime on top of it.
#
# /_astro/* filenames carry Astro's content hash, so a change is a new URL and the
# old one can be immutable for a year. The site emits no /_astro/ assets today --
# the CSS is inlined and there is no script -- so this rule is inert until one is
# added. /figures/* filenames do NOT carry a hash: fig-01..28 and the genealogy
# pair keep stable names and their contents do get corrected. They are long-lived
# at the edge (s-maxage, which a deploy purge can flush) and short in the browser
# (max-age + must-revalidate, which no purge can reach). Do NOT add immutable to
# /figures/*: a corrected diagram would then not reach a reader who already has
# the old one.
#
# This file is NOT what served /privacy/, /important/, /auth-callback/ and
# /blog/neurodivergent/ as HTTP 200 after they were removed, and changing it did
# not fix them. Measured 2026-09-20: the Pages origin 404s all four
# (jeyanandan.pages.dev and a ?cb= query both 404), no s-maxage or x-robots-tag
# string exists anywhere in this repo, and after this file shipped the four URLs
# picked up the new cache-control while still returning the OLD body with an age:
# that never reset -- across a deployment whose purge step is best-effort. A cache
# at the jeyanandan.com zone holds them. Only a Cloudflare purge clears it.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-src https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; media-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/figures/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, s-maxage=604800, must-revalidate
